OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry, bright day with plenty
OL,6,Fof warm sunny spells. Sunshine will
OL,7,Fturn a little hazy at times through
OL,8,Fthe afternoon. Winds will be light.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FA dry evening with some sunny
OL,11,Fspells to end the day. Remaining dry
OL,12,Fovernight with variable cloud and some
OL,13,Fclear spells. Turning quite chilly in
OL,14,Fsome sheltered rural spots.
OL,15,
OL,16,CTuesday:FA dry and bright day with
OL,17,Fvariable cloud and some hazy sunny
OL,18,Fspells. Light winds and becoming very
OL,19,Fwarm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
